WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:02.912
A dictionary can be looped in several ways.

00:00:02.912 --> 00:00:09.767
Keys gives labels, values gives the stored values, and items gives both together.

00:00:09.767 --> 00:00:16.097
Here items is the most useful because we want both the survey question and its score.

00:00:16.097 --> 00:00:20.367
After printing each pair, the values are averaged.

00:00:20.367 --> 00:00:24.070
Four, five, and three have an average of four.

00:00:24.520 --> 00:00:30.816
This is a common pattern when the labels matter during reporting but the values are used for calculation.
